liquid-xmlobjects-runtime provides CMake targets.

The RTTR library (a dependency) cannot be built as a static library with the dynamic CRT, so the triplets are:
    Windows   x64-windows (shared library), x64-windows-static (static library, static CRT)
    Linux     x64-linux-dynamic  (not x64-linux)
    macOS     arm64-osx-dynamic, x64-osx-dynamic  (not arm64-osx, x64-osx)

    find_package(LiquidXmlObjectsRuntime CONFIG REQUIRED)
    # static triplets
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Liquid::XmlObjectsRuntime)
    # dynamic triplets
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Liquid::XmlObjectsRuntimeShared)

#include <LiquidTechnologies/XmlObjects/LxSerializer.h>
